# Ht Web — Design Repository

This repository contains the **HTML and JS design files** for **Ht Web**, generated and maintained by the **HT Design Agent**.

---

## Setup

### Prompt

> Clone `git@bitbucket.org:htds/ht_web.git` and then clone `git@bitbucket.org:htds/designagent.git` into `.github/` so it can act as the Design Agent for the project.

### 1. Clone This Project

```bash
git clone git@bitbucket.org:htds/ht_web.git
cd ht_web
```

### 2. Clone the Design Agent

```bash
git clone git@bitbucket.org:htds/designagent.git .github
```

> The `.github/` folder is listed in `.gitignore` — the agent repo remains fully independent and is **not** tracked by this project's Git.

