## Workflow

1. **Design Agent** reads from Figma and generates HTML/JS screens
2. All generated code is committed here for version tracking
3. Modify designs by updating the PRD or tokens, then re-run the agent
4. Review changes through 4. ReviewGit diffs and pull requests

